sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Student
  participant B as Support bot
  participant M as Mentor
  S->>B: I am stuck
  activate B
  B->>B: Search the syllabus
  alt found a lesson
    B-->>S: Here is the lesson
  else nothing relevant
    B->>M: Escalate with context
    M-->>S: Pairing booked
  end
  deactivate B
  loop every sprint
    S->>M: Progress check
  end
  Note over S,M: Reviewed weekly
  S-xB: Close the ticket
